{"path":"eventstory/ev1004/event_ev1004_05_01","commands":[{"class":"NaniSummary","line":0,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"클레어를 데리고 탈주한 메이드들을 잡으러 나섰다.\n모두의 즐거운 휴가를 위해, 복구 작업은 계속되어야만 한다.","en":"I set off with Claire to catch the runaway maids.\nFor everyone's fun vacation, the restoration work must go on.","ja":"クレアを連れて脱走したメイドたちの捕獲に向かった。\nみんなの楽しいバカンスのため、復旧作業は続けられなければならない。","zh-Hans":"我带着克莱尔出去抓捕那些逃跑的女仆。\n为了所有人能享受一个快乐假期，修复工作必须继续进行。","zh-Hant":"帶上克萊爾，出發去抓那些逃跑的女僕們。\n為了大家的愉快假期，修復工作必須繼續下去。","th":"ผมพาแคลร์ออกไปไล่จับพวกเมดที่หลบหนี\nเพื่อวันหยุดอันแสนสุขของทุกคน งานบูรณะจะต้องดำเนินต่อไป","es":"Salí en busca de las maids huidas acompañado de Claire.\nPor unas vacaciones divertidas para todos, los trabajos de restauración deben continuar."}}},{"class":"TitleCommand","line":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":2,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":3,"fields":{"Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"-175,,-1","IdAndAppearance":"maid_swimsuit_301","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":4,"fields":{"Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"-150","IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102.fear","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyBackground","line":5,"fields":{"Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","AppearanceAndTransition":"BG_Sand_Beach","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PlaceCommand","line":6,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"???","en":"???","ja":"？？？","zh-Hans":"？？？","zh-Hant":"？？？","th":"???","es":"¿¿¿???"}}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":7,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":31,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Waves_01","Loop":"true","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":32,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Sand_move_03","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":33,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102","Wait":"false","Count":"7","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":34,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102","LookDirection":"Right","Wait":"false","Destination":"30","Duration":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":35,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_swimsuit_301","Wait":"false","Count":"7","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":36,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_swimsuit_301","Wait":"true","Destination":"70","Duration":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"AuthorCommand","line":38,"fields":{"CharacterId":"maid_swimsuit_301","AuthorLabel":"","AuthorAlias":""},"loc":{"AuthorLabel":{"ko":"소심한 메이드","en":"Timid Maid","ja":"気弱なメイド","zh-Hans":"胆小的女仆","zh-Hant":"膽小的女僕","th":"เมดขี้อาย","es":"Maid tímida"},"AuthorAlias":{"ko":"메이드 가드","en":"Maid Guard","ja":"メイドガード","zh-Hans":"女仆守卫","zh-Hant":"女僕守衛","th":"เมดการ์ด","es":"Maid Guard"}}},{"class":"AuthorCommand","line":39,"fields":{"CharacterId":"maid_bikini_102","AuthorLabel":"","AuthorAlias":""},"loc":{"AuthorLabel":{"ko":"호탕한 메이드","en":"Boisterous Maid","ja":"豪快なメイド","zh-Hans":"豪爽的女仆","zh-Hant":"豪爽的女僕","th":"เมดสายลุย","es":"Maid eufórica"},"AuthorAlias":{"ko":"메이드 가드","en":"Maid Guard","ja":"メイドガード","zh-Hans":"女仆守卫","zh-Hant":"女僕守衛","th":"เมดการ์ด","es":"Maid Guard"}}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":41,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":42,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_bikini_102","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"헉헉!\n끄, 끈질긴 녀석들! 후우...!","texts":{"en":"*Pant*, *pant*!\nTh-They just won't give up! Phew...!","ja":"ゼー、ゼー！\nし、しつこい奴ら！ ふう……！","zh-Hans":"呼哈！\n真、真难缠的家伙！呼呜……！","zh-Hant":"呼哧呼哧！\n死、死纏爛打的傢伙！呼……！","th":"แฮ่ก แฮ่ก!\nต... ตื๊อไม่เลิกเลยนะ พวกนี้นี่! ฟู่...!","es":"¡*Jadear, jadear*!\n¡M-Malditos, qué pesados son! ¡Uf...!"},"author":"maid_bikini_102"},{"class":"PrintText","line":43,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_bikini_102","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...뭐야, 우리 둘뿐이야?\n다들 뿔뿔이 흩어진 건가...?","texts":{"en":"...What, is it just the two of us?\nDid everyone get scattered...?","ja":"……何よ、うちの二人だけ？\nみんな散り散りになっちゃったのかな……？","zh-Hans":"……怎么，就只有我们两个？\n大家都走散了吗……？","zh-Hant":"……什麼，只剩下我們兩個？\n大家都走散了嗎……？","th":"...อะไรกัน มีแค่เราสองคนงั้นเหรอ?\nคนอื่นกระจัดกระจายกันไปหมดแล้วเหรอเนี่ย...?","es":"...¿Eh? ¿Solo quedamos nosotras dos?\n¿Acaso nos hemos separado de las demás...?"},"author":"maid_bikini_102"},{"class":"StopSfx","line":45,"fields":{"FadeOutDuration":"2","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":46,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"maid_swimsuit_301.sweat3","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":47,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_swimsuit_301","Wait":"false","Power":"-3","Duration":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":48,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_swimsuit_301","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"히극, 히이...!\n더는, 헉헉... 모, 못 뛰겠어요...","texts":{"en":"Hicc, eek...!\nI can't... *pant*, *gasp*... run any more...","ja":"ひっく、ひいっ……！\nもう、ゼー、ゼー……は、走れませんぇ……","zh-Hans":"呜呃，噫……！\n呼哧……实在跑、跑不动了……","zh-Hant":"嗝、噫……！\n再也……哈啊，哈啊……跑、跑不動了啦……","th":"ฮึก ฮี้...!\nไม่... แฮ่ก แฮ่ก... วิ่ง... วิ่งไม่ไหวแล้วค่ะ...","es":"¡*Hic*, ay...!\nYa no... *jadear, jadear*... p-puedo correr más..."},"author":"maid_swimsuit_301"},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":50,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102","Wait":"false","Duration":"0.3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":51,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_bikini_102","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"좀만 힘내!\n저기까지만 가면 숨을 만한 곳이 있을 거야!","texts":{"en":"Hang in there a bit longer!\nOnce we get over there, we can find a hiding spot!","ja":"もう少し頑張って！\nあそこまで行けば隠れられる場所があるはずよ！","zh-Hans":"再坚持一下！\n只要跑到那里，应该就有能藏身的地方了！","zh-Hant":"再撐一下！\n只要跑到那邊應該就有地方可以躲了！","th":"ฮึดไว้น่า!\nไปถึงตรงนั้นน่าจะมีที่พอให้หลบซ่อนได้อยู่!","es":"¡Resiste un poco más!\n¡Si llegamos hasta allí, seguro que encontramos un sitio para escondernos!"},"author":"maid_bikini_102"},{"class":"PrintText","line":52,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_bikini_102","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"자, 내가 부축해 줄 테니까!","texts":{"en":"Come on, I'll support you!","ja":"ほら、私が肩を貸してあげるから！","zh-Hans":"来，我扶着你！","zh-Hant":"來，我撐著妳走！","th":"มา เดี๋ยวฉันช่วยพยุงเอง!","es":"¡Venga, sostente en mí!"},"author":"maid_bikini_102"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":54,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":55,"fields":{"Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":56,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102.smile","Wait":"true","Destination":"50","Duration":"0.7","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":57,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Rummage_03","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":58,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102","Wait":"true","Destination":",40","Duration":"0.4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"StopSfx","line":59,"fields":{"FadeOutDuration":"1","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":60,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102","Wait":"true","Destination":",50","Duration":"0.4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":63,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":64,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"maid_swimsuit_301.sweat2","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":65,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_swimsuit_301.embarrassed","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":65,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_swimsuit_301","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"흑... 미안해요, 저 때문에...","texts":{"en":"Sob... I'm sorry, it's all because of me...","ja":"ヒック……ごめんなさい、私のせいで……","zh-Hans":"呜……对不起，都是因为我……","zh-Hant":"嗚……對不起，都是因為我……","th":"ฮือ... ขอโทษนะคะ เพราะฉันแท้ๆ...","es":"*Snif*... Lo siento, es todo por mi culpa..."},"author":"maid_swimsuit_301"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":67,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102.default","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":67,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_bikini_102","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"헹, 이럴 땐 고맙다고 하는 거야.","texts":{"en":"Heh, in times like this, you say thank you.","ja":"ふん、こういう時は『ありがとう』って言うのよ。","zh-Hans":"哼，这种时候应该说谢谢才对。","zh-Hant":"哼，這種時候該說的是謝謝啦。","th":"เชอะ เวลาแบบนี้ต้องพูดว่าขอบคุณสิยะ","es":"Je, en momentos así, lo que hay que decir es \"gracias\"."},"author":"maid_bikini_102"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":68,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_swimsuit_301.happy","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":69,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_bikini_102","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"나중에 한턱내기나 햇―","texts":{"en":"Just buy me a treat later—","ja":"後でおごってくれれば――","zh-Hans":"回头你可得请客——","zh-Hant":"之後請我吃頓好的就——","th":"ไว้คราวหน้าเลี้ยงเหล้าฉันด้วยล่ะกัน—","es":"¡Más te vale invitarme a algo luego—!"},"author":"maid_bikini_102"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":71,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":72,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Rope_02","FadeInDuration":"1","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":73,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SFX_BG_27_DigSand","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":74,"fields":{"Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":75,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_swimsuit_301.embarrassed","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterRollCommand","line":76,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102.fear","Wait":"true","To":"5","Pivot":"0","Duration":"0.2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterRollCommand","line":77,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102.fear","Wait":"true","To":"-5","Pivot":"0","Duration":"0.4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterRollCommand","line":78,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102.fear","Wait":"true","To":"5","Pivot":"0","Duration":"0.2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterRollCommand","line":79,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102.fear","Wait":"true","To":"-5","Pivot":"0","Duration":"0.4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":82,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":83,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_bikini_102","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"우와아아아앗!!!","texts":{"en":"Whoaaaaa!!!","ja":"きゃあぁぁぁっ！！","zh-Hans":"哇啊啊啊啊！！！","zh-Hant":"哇啊啊啊啊！！！","th":"หวอออออออ!!!","es":"¡¡¡Uwaaaah!!!"},"author":"maid_bikini_102"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":84,"fields":{"ActorIds":"*"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":85,"fields":{"Wait":"false"}},{"class":"CharacterRollCommand","line":86,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_bikini_102","Wait":"false","To":"90","Pivot":"0","Duration":"0.2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterRollCommand","line":87,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"maid_swimsuit_301","Wait":"true","To":"90","Pivot":"0","Duration":"0.2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":88,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Bump_03","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"Spawn","line":89,"fields":{"Path":"ShakeCamera","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":92,"fields":{"Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"ExWide","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":93,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":94,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"maid_swimsuit_301","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"꺄아아앗!!!","texts":{"en":"Kyaaaaa!!!","ja":"きゃあぁぁっ！！","zh-Hans":"呀啊啊啊！！！","zh-Hant":"呀啊啊啊！！！","th":"กรี๊ดดดดด!!!","es":"¡¡¡Kyaaaah!!!"},"author":"maid_swimsuit_301"},{"class":"StopBgm","line":96,"fields":{"FadeOutDuration":"3","Wait":"false"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":97,"fields":{}},{"class":"HideAllActors","line":98,"fields":{"Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"DestroyAllSpawned","line":99,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":100,"fields":{"WaitMode":"1.5"}},{"class":"Skip","line":101,"fields":{"Enable":"false"}},{"class":"End","line":103,"fields":{"Fade":"1"}}]}